Files produced by Cadence Allegro PE24.1

Artwork:
--------

Format: Gerber RS-274X , parameters described in art_param.txt. 
All layers viewed from top

Build:
------

10-layers
ENIG finish to outer layers except for edge connector which should have a "hard gold" finish.

Layers as follows:

mib_rev3b_v233_01_Top.art
mib_rev3b_v233_02_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v233_03_sig1.art
mib_rev3b_v233_04_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v233_05_PWR1.art
mib_rev3b_v233_06_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v233_07_SIG2.art
mib_rev3b_v233_08_GND.art
mib_rev3b_v233_09_SIG3.art
mib_rev3b_v233_10_Bottom.art


Areas with selective hard gold finish:
--------------------------------------
mib_rev3b_v233_16_hardgold_top.art
mib_rev3b_v233_17_hardgold_bot.art

Tented/filled vias:
------------

There are a number of thermal pads with vias in the pad.
To prevent solder paste wicking into the vias the vias should be either "tented" or filled. Whichever is most econonical.


Solder Masks
------------

mib_rev3b_v233_13_smask_top.art
mib_rev3b_v233_14_smask_bot.art

Colour - green. 

